{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_03",
  "title": "The First Raid",
  "storyCode": "MB-3",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "34d45d4ab597db8a35389e9352038f17ab1233b5df67f80f610e9686b02fc9a9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Robin's not a professional assassin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even I could tell that much. She had none of the air about her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like the material I had on her was correct. She really was a security worker. Her skills certainly should've invited trust."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But this all smacks of a little weirdness to me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why they hire her is my question... but that's not too important. Skip it for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "More importantly, it seems most of the assassins were like Robin in that they'd been hired solo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They had no idea if they had any competition, and no clue who their employer was."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How many assassins did HydeBro hire, in the end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your guess is as good as mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But just like I said before, the Bros paid big to get rid of Anthony. Money with their blood and sweat in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How did the assassins get into the prison?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sure you looked into it beforehand, too—Mansfield State Prison was established jointly by a few of the state's municipal governments, and it stands alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm. The way I've seen it described, the founding intent of the prison was to serve its state breaking new ground. Development was rapid, but crime rates stayed high, and rampant."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So at the time, it was a half-abandoned industrial platform."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was Randal, the current warden, who suggested establishing the prison to the city governments. All at once, they had a solution for what to do with the platform, and where to put inmates."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Any questions so far?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't the answer pretty obvious, though?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The idea is the prison gets used as a lockbox to shove every 'troublesome' person. And it's the people none of the cities want to bother with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Getting inside isn't the tough part."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ms. Kafka never told you how exactly she got in there, am I right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course, the prison is still a prison. Getting out is tough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Like I said, it only visits cities on the edge once every few months. The rest of the time, it stops in the barrens."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A convict escapes out there, they're stuck in the endless barrens until they die."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here's the thing. Robin mentioned it. A mysterious person promised it. There was a way to get them out for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So as long as they didn't slip up and get themselves killed in there, AND successfully ran the hit on Anthony, then they'd just need to wait for extraction."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But they sent in a lot of other assassins. Would HydeBro really be able to retrieve each and every one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Which is why I said none of them knew about the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And once they were inside, even if they figured it out, there'd be no escape. Their only option would be to kill Anthony or die trying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a simple, effective method."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I still don't understand—why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Simon Co. had shut down. Its core members were all in prison. HydeBro never once touched them. Why move against Anthony alone, of all people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh. Do I actually have to start from there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, Ms. Silence, now I know you really didn't care much about this in the past."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Buuut, maybe you pulled something so bold and brash—and succeeded—precisely because you didn't realize."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry, sorry, I'm not making fun of you here. In fact, you can take it as me complimenting you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right, as for your question, first of all, let me answer it with a question—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ms. Silence, have you ever thought about how if you wanted to dispose of Anthony in prison, assassins are actually one of the least efficient methods?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Because there are much better ways. Buying off the jailers, maybe bribing the warden..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But sending an assassin to dress up as a prisoner, get into prison and kill another prisoner... when you hear it out loud, it sounds dumb, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Because they... couldn't?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yep, because they couldn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whoo, from the way you reacted to this prison's history just now, I'm gonna need to give you a walkthrough of this side from the top, Ms. Silence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you still remember Kafka recalling the prison's Superintendent Barton? What did he say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_undergroundF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_135",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We are Mansfield State Prison. State! Prison. We are a pilot penitentiary with special approval from the capital. We will serve as a shining example to the other states."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pilot. Special approval. You know what that implies?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It implies business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In Columbia, the most profitable business is wherever the power is. This prison's a model case."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm telling you this prison is in fact Warden Randal's money machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But it's a prison!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure is. A heavily guarded prison. Send whoever you don't like in there for a fate worse than death. Send whoever you wanna safeguard in there to be protected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whatever you need, as long as you have the money."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't you go 'wow, that's a super-sized business opportunity?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But in that case... could HydeBro not just pay the warden the requisite amount, and he'd help them do their work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "One second you're stunned beyond belief hearing it, the next you force yourself to switch lanes and rail your thought in full steam."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You really are amazing, Ms. Silence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't feel like you're complimenting me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your query's totally reasonable, but truth is I don't have a clear-cut answer either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But we can work backwards—in conclusion, they didn't do that. And surely they tried it before. So the only possible answer is they failed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Personally, I think it's because the warden didn't want to get himself stuck between a rock and a hard place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or perhaps Anthony's mistreatment could be bought, but Anthony also had a massive influence in the prison. If he died, you sure couldn't handle it like a typical prisoner death."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A lot of people'd love Randal's position, and as far as I know, he's got major guile too. I don't think he'd take the risk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Someone like him? It's more likely he took HydeBro's money and just did nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I remember Anthony once saying he'd fled to Ironforge City before he was finally arrested..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perhaps his father had some involvement in the affair?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm. Yeah, that's possible as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ol' Smith used to be a fair household name in Bunkerhill City. Sending his son to prison for his protection wouldn't surprise me one bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But that doesn't answer my question."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've already answered it, Ms. Silence. You're smart. You just don't want to believe it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I don't understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What I mean is they couldn't do it in Mansfield State Prison, but that doesn't mean they couldn't do it in Bunkerhill City Prison."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, you don't mean his family..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like you finally understand, Ms. Silence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You said that HydeBro never touched Anthony's family. That's a faulty assumption."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The only reason they're not dead is because they don't need to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe you just can't comprehend it, but in Columbia, death's far from the worst thing that could happen to a person."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Moreover, after dealing with Simon Co., HydeBro had no competitors left. They obviously wouldn't ever let the Simon family turn their next page."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They said as much, the Simons posed no more threat..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So once they discovered Anthony was in a prison they had no influence over, they decided Anthony was a threat?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Correct. As long as Anthony lives, they always face the risk of a comeback."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So. HydeBro had a grip over their local lockup, but none at all on the prison a couple states over, Mansfield State Prison."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No. Wait! They're a business! Even if our Energy Section is backing them, what in the world gives them any say in the local prison?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well? What in the world, indeed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're—you're not—no, I refuse to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dinner's ready. Eat something, you guys."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Eep. You look like you've seen a ghost, Silence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I need a moment to cool my head... Mayer, if I could trouble you to continue explaining the events to Director Muelsyse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmuh? Sure thing~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Silence, you wanna eat on the side and listen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, I need somewhere a little quieter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can head into the kitchen, then. There's a table there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silence",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay, so where did you leave off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We finished Robin's past and what she was doing in the prison."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, I got it. Then next should be her first failed hit..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uh, or from Kafka's perspective, her successfully getting in touch with Anthony."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow, so this is when the two of them cross paths?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mmyup."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let me guessy-guess. Robin's thing about entering C-Zone for cleaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's that, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Kafka went for it, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I imagine she heard it was the safest way to meet Anthony."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ahah. Now that's straight to the punch. I like it~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All the middle stuff's pretty nothing. You wanna hear it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mmm... I'd be lying if I said I wasn't intrigued. I feel like I'd hear some pretty interesting things. But let's stick to the jailbreak itself first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you wanna hear Kafka or Robin's side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll keep wiiiith Robin's."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Cool. It was a whole month since she went inside, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All the while, she kept her head down and worked. Finally clawed out the chance to go to C-Zone for cleaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Used every material at her disposal, made all the weapons she could count on. Packed them on her person."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sounds like she was pretty amply prepared. Did she get sussed by Anthony, then? Or stopped by Kafka?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nope. Something wild happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_prison_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All present?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A-Zone Prisoners",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_132",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoners",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hey, you're fresh meat too, right? I've seen you before at the factory.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Listen up. You've got new inmates among you, so I'll repeat the rules."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A-Zone and B-Zone are responsible for different rooms. The two of us will take you separately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you will all get one turn cleaning up Mr. Anthony's room."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heheh. Why's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's called respect. You understand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_136",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...A-Zone with me, B-Zone with him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll make it brief. Once you're in, don't touch what you shouldn't. Don't even think about taking what you shouldn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do your work. Especially when it comes to Mr. Anthony's room. You are to clean his room like you care for your own mommy. Is that clear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heheh. Like I give a slug's ass about my mommy, hehey."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You, shut it. I'm saying this for the first-timers here. Don't give me trouble, you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I got it, I got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Behave, and we'll give you some playtime in an empty C-cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whew, now that's a perk. I'll be good as a baby, then, heheh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Enough! You all got your cleaning gear on you? If so, we'll get ready to go upstairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomC"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(So these are the C-Zone cells... I've finally gotten in.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Every story has four cells. Each cell only links to the elevator.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(But the style of these cells is so different to ours. It feels like... there's no privacy at all here.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get down to it. Stop gawking around."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_136",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Over here is Anthony's... Mr. Anthony's room."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_136",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like the other side's there already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_136",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just get in there and clean up. Don't think about brawling with B-Zone here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_136",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll be watching you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(This jailer's not like the others. Real domineering...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Focus. I finally get to see Anthony.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(In all the photos, he's built crazy strong. If I took him on directly, I'd have no chance of winning.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(But no matter how strong the person, as long as you can find a weak point, there's a chance...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Just clean up while you look for it. Even if finding a weak point's all I get, I'll take it.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Pop, protect me.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(A jailer and a few B-Zoners got taken out.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who are you? Why kill me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You don't need to know who wants you dead, Mr. Anthony."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All you need to know is this is where you die. Heheh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Boss, the A-Zone team's here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Came fast, heheh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No problem. Bud, you take that batch out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't go killin' now. We still gotta get outta here, heheh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(No way. They're here to take out Anthony too...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whyn'tcha take this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get outta my way, brat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(He knocked that girl stupid in one punch too...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_136",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Huh. Did that jailer smirk just now...?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Ugh, now's not the time to worry. This one's coming for me. I gotta deal with him first!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
